  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse the same pyramid and cone from part \u003cb\u003ea\u003c/b\u003e. Find the \u003cb\u003etotal \u003c/b\u003esurface area of the pyramid and the cone for different values of \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e. Find the ratio between the two total surface areas. What do you notice?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\"problemstatement_figure\"\u003e\n \u003cimg src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_7b_80/f-80-7a-q.gif\"\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFind the formula for the total surface area of a right regular pyramid with side length 2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e and slant height 1.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFrom part \u003cb\u003ea,\u003c/b\u003e the formula for the lateral surface area of the pyramid is\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"139\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_7b_80/image014.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe area of the base is (2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e)\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e \u003d 4\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e, so the total surface area is\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"97\" height\u003d\"21\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_7b_80/image015.gif\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFind the formula for the total surface area of the cone.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFrom part \u003cb\u003ea\u003c/b\u003e, the formula for the lateral surface area of the cone is\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"69\" height\u003d\"25\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_7b_80/image016.gif\" class\u003d\"text-top\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe area of the base is \u003ci\u003eπ\u003c/i\u003e\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e, so the total surface area is\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"101\" height\u003d\"21\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_7b_80/image017.gif\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the two functions into your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the two functions into your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20300\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20300\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e. For Y\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e, key in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20301\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20302\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20302\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20303\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qplus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20303\u0026quot;,203)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20304\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20305\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20305\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20306\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qxsqr.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20306\u0026quot;,260)\"\u003e. For Y\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e, key in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20307\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20308\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qpi.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20308\u0026quot;,200)\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20309\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20309\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20310\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qplus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20310\u0026quot;,203)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20311\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20312\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qpi.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20312\u0026quot;,200)\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20313\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20313\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20314\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qxsqr.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20314\u0026quot;,260)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_7b_80/f-80-7b-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eUse a table.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20315\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20316\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtblset.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20316\u0026quot;,231)\"\u003e and make sure TblStart \u003d 1 and Δ Tbl \u003d 1.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20317\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20318\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtable.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20318\u0026quot;,228)\"\u003e to view the table.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-7 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_7b_80/f-80-7b-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFind the ratio between the total surface areas.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTo find the ratio between the total surface areas, go back to \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20319\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20319\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e. For Y\u003csub\u003e3\u003c/sub\u003e, key in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20320\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20321\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qvars.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20321\u0026quot;,250)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20322\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20323\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20324\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdivide.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20324\u0026quot;,133)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20325\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20326\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qvars.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20326\u0026quot;,250)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20327\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20328\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-9 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_7b_80/f-80-7b-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eGo back to the table.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20329\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20330\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtable.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20330\u0026quot;,228)\"\u003e to go back to the table, and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20331\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20331\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20332\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20332\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20333\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20333\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e to see the Y\u003csub\u003e3\u003c/sub\u003e column.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe ratio of total surface areas is approximately 1.2732. That is, the total surface area of the pyramid is about 1.2732 times that of the cone.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThis is the same ratio we got with the lateral surface areas.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-11 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_7b_80/f-80-7b-4.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    }
  ]
